# Native Elements Boundary

- Direct usage of native HTML elements must be concentrated in Atomic Design base layers:
  - `src/ui/atoms/**`
  - `src/ui/molecules/**`
  - `src/ui/organisms/**`
- In higher layers (`templates`, `components`, `pages`), prefer composing existing atomic components.
- If a new visual behavior is required, extend the relevant atomic component with new props instead of adding raw HTML in higher layers.
- Keep atomic components generic and reusable; do not couple them to feature-specific business logic.

## Guidance

- Need a custom button style? Add props to an atom button.
- Need a new layout variation? Extend a molecule/organism API.
- Need a feature screen? Compose atomic components in `ui/components`.
